# A package that EXPORTS a subclass of a generic class without declaring its own
# constructor. The inherited signature has to be the substituted one in the
# declaration, the emitted ctor, and the consumer's import alike — if the three
# disagree the exporting package's module cannot be linked at all.
# name        dir   deps       root
@test/base    base  -
@test/mid     mid   @test/base
main          app   @test/mid  root
